    "created_at": "2016-04-06T00:52:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-06T00:52:18Z",
    "body": "All possible children of Element + Document&mdash;does it make sense to put this on Node? I suppose Document, DocumentFragment, and ShadowRoot .closest return null? (/cc @hayatoito for ShadowRoot.)\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
