    "created_at": "2016-04-06T06:41:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-06T06:41:19Z",
    "body": "So, it does not make much sense for `Document`, `DocumentType`, `DocumentFragment`, `ShadowRoot`, and `Attr`, if it comes back as a node, but it seems there's at least a use case for `Document`. And if `Document` makes sense, even if it only ever returns null, so does `ShadowRoot`.\n\nIf we put it on node we should probably use `[Unscopable]`.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
